        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Given in 1959 by Miss C E Gallini, who attributed them to an Italian ancestor.  No equivalent Italian examples or references have been found.  There are images of very similar garments in Dutch genre scenes of the 1660s and 1670s, so these have been described as possibly Dutch."@en .

